# Build-context filter for all images built with THIS directory (the workspace
# root) as context:
#   - Mission Designer  : MissionDesigner/docker-compose.yml (context: ..) -> MissionDesigner/Dockerfile
#   - Mission Autopilot : docker-compose.yml `mission-autopilot-*`           -> MissionAutopilot/Dockerfile
#   - Mission Commander : docker-compose.yml `mission-commander`              -> MissionCommander/Dockerfile
#   - Mission Engine    : docker-compose.yml `mission-engine`              -> MissionEngine/Dockerfile
#   - Mission Broker    : docker-compose.yml `mission-broker`              -> MissionBroker/Dockerfile
#
# The Designer build reproduces the dev sibling layout (MissionDesigner +
# MissionFormKit) so its `file:` deps on @mission/form-* resolve as TS source.
# The Autopilot console build reaches into MissionDesigner for @mission/ui +
# @mission/tokens. Ignore everything, re-include only the repos those builds
# need, then drop heavy/irrelevant contents.
#
# (The Tester image builds from its OWN subdirectory context with its own
# .dockerignore — this file does not affect it.)

# Ignore everything by default...
*

# ...re-include only the repos the workspace-context builds need.
!MissionDesigner
!MissionFormKit
!MissionAutopilot
# Command Module (docker-compose.yml `mission-commander`) + Mission Engine
# (docker-compose.yml `mission-engine`) + the mission-control-db package both
# consume as TypeScript source via a file: dep.
# NOTE the capital T: .dockerignore matching is CASE-SENSITIVE even though Windows
# resolves the path either way, so a lowercase spelling here silently excludes the
# whole directory and the build fails with "not found" on the first COPY.
!MissionCommander
!MissionEngine
# Mission Broker (docker-compose.yml `mission-broker`).
!MissionBroker
!mission-control-db
# Mission Pilot (phase 4b): built inside the Mission Engine image (vite outDir
# targets ../MissionEngine/public) and served by the engine at /. It
# consumes MissionFormKit's form-renderer/form-schema/form-tokens as `file:`
# deps — MissionFormKit is already re-included above.
!MissionPilot

# Drop heavy / irrelevant content inside the re-included repos.
**/node_modules
**/dist
# TypeScript incremental-build state. MUST be excluded: with **/dist stripped
# above, a stale tsbuildinfo makes `tsc --build` skip re-emitting .d.ts files.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.git
**/.claude
**/.planning
**/.superpowers
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vs
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Generated secrets must never enter a build layer or cache. The last matching
# pattern wins, so these sit after the re-includes above; examples stay.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
MissionDesigner/Trajectory-dist
MissionDesigner/Trajectory-dist.zip
MissionDesigner/.dev-backups
MissionDesigner/test-data
MissionDesigner/e2e
MissionDesigner/docs
